Speaker amplifiers, first look (spesamp=1): SE1 clock vote and its I2C firmware/FIFO state.

No bus transfer and no amplifier reset: the next step reads the aw87xxx chip ids at
0x58/0x5b only when SE1 has I2C firmware with 32-bit FIFOs.

